<h1>Starter packs</h1>
<p class="lede">
  Not sure where to start? Each pack is a small shelf of writing worth your
  time, picked by hand, with a line on why. Add a whole pack to nine turtles,
  or take it to any feed reader you like.
</p>
<ol class="posts">
  {%- for pack in collections.packs %}
  <li>
    <h2><a href="{{ pack.url }}">{{ pack.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ pack.data.description }}</p>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ol>
